Table 8 offers insights into each model’s capability to generate sequences that are both AMP and possess a helical structure with high confidence (P(AMP>0.95) and P(helix>0.95)). As shown, AMPGAN demonstrates the highest count of sequences meeting both objectives. This notable performance likely stems from the fact that AMPGAN incorporates more biological knowledge into its design, enabling it to generate sequences that are not only likely to be AMPs but also possess the necessary structural characteristics, such as \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
